- Add Supabase client (lib/supabase.js)
- Add login page: sign in/up, inline error messages, remember-me
- Onboarding: save intake to profiles table on submit, kick off
  program build, then redirect to /dashboard after 'You're locked in'
- Add lib/buildProgram.js: maps intake answers to the algorithm
  engine's generateWeekSchedule() to produce the first week
- Dashboard: auth guard, polls profiles.program_ready every 2.5s
  (60s timeout) with a loading state, renders real profile/program
  data once ready
- Root page now redirects to /dashboard or /login based on session
- DB: added profiles.program (jsonb) and profiles.program_ready
  (bool, default false) columns via Supabase migration
